# OneLesson

Anonymous, searchable lessons learned from real job interviews. No reviews,
no salary talk, just the specific thing someone wishes they'd known before
walking in.

Live at [onelesson.xyz](https://www.onelesson.xyz)

## Stack
- Next.js
- Supabase
- Google Gemini API (content moderation)
- Vercel

## Author
Built and maintained by Joshua Adegbite ([@Horlladjosh](https://twitter.com/horllad_josh)).

